Z||000007||FieroJoe||01-02-2001||08:51 PM||||I rarely see other Fiero's in my area, but once I saw this white GT fastback, going the other way than I on a divided highway, and we both checked out each other's cars until we had passed each other too much.  I saw him looking at me when I looked at him.  The wierd thing is that i saw him again the next day and waved that time, and he too waved back.  <P><BR>Kinda neat, and once I even saw a blue coupe just like mine, but not in as nice of shape  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">, of course!||||reg||1
